      "chapter": "Price and Commodity Control",
      "table_no": null,
      "title": "[Government organs in charge of price and commodity control]",
      "caption_extra": "Government organs in charge of price and commodity control are as follows:",
      "continued": false,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": null,
          "columns": [
            "No.",
            "Organ",
            "Sub-item",
            "Text"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "(1)",
              "The Ministry of Finance",
              "(a)",
              "The Foreign Trade Commission. Under the Commission are the China National Tea Corporation, the Foo Shing Trading Corporation, the Universal Trading Corporation and other organs."
            ],
            [
              "(1)",
              "The Ministry of Finance",
              "(b)",
              "The Salt Administration and its subsidiary organs."
            ],
            [
              "(1)",
              "The Ministry of Finance",
              "(c)",
              "Tobacco, sugar and match monopoly administrations and their subsidiary organs."
            ],
            [
              "(2)",
              "The Ministry of Economic Affairs",
              "(a)",
              "The National Resources Commission. Under the Commission are the Tungsten Control Administration, the Antimony Control Administration, the Szechwan-Sikang Copper Control Administration, the Tin Control Administration, the Mercury Control Administration, and a number of other industrial and mining units."
            ],
            [
              "(2)",
              "The Ministry of Economic Affairs",
              "(b)",
              "The Industrial and Mining Adjustment Administration"
            ],
            [
              "(2)",
              "The Ministry of Economic Affairs",
              "(c)",
              "the Commodity Administration. Under the Administration are the Agricultural Credit Administration, the Bureau for the Purchase and Sale at Equitable Prices, the Coal Control Administration, and Vegetable Oil Control Administration. The Commodity Administration was dissolved in December, 1942. Its functions were taken over separately by the Ministries of Finance and Economic Affairs."
            ],
            [
              "(3)",
              "The Ministry of Food",
              "(a)",
              "Provincial and municipal food administrations and food administrative departments of hsien governments."
            ],
            [
              "(3)",
              "The Ministry of Food",
              "(b)",
              "Other subsidiary organs."
            ],
            [
              "(4)",
              "The Transportation Control Administration of the National Military Council",
              "",
              ""
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
